## What We Are Building

A run of studio-infrastructure hardening across five threads, all pushed to `master` (origin synced 0/0):

1. **Stapler canon** redesigned from a 3D-cinematic-photo bureaucrat → simple Sandy-style cartoon (light-blue suit + tie, small stapler head, stapler hands). Image + text canon swapped in place on the LOCKED asset.
2. **`locked-canon-asset-replace` skill + muscle script** — captures the invariant "replace a LOCKED canon asset in place" flow (gate → Drive → freshness bump → verify) so the gotchas can't be forgotten again.
3. **Learning loop** — audited the distiller handoff, REJECTED building a distiller (additive), killed the write-only capture hook, archived the 535KB inbox after distilling its gold. The loop now lives in-session: correction → repo-tracked skill → git → both machines.
4. **HoG analytics** — three verified bugs unblocked so the growth advisor sees real impressions/CTR/subs instead of hardcoded zeros.
5. **Skill-loader hardening** — the loader no longer silently drops a broken SKILL.md; caught a real casualty (`sandy-gag-library` was silently dead).
6. **Time-inject hook** — stops me fabricating the Dubai timestamp (3rd incident → mechanism).

